   "lines": [
    "We sailed to Green-",
    "-port, the wind",
    "being light and",
    "puffy. Having",
    "several hundred",
    "cartridges aboard",
    "we practise with",
    "our revolvers at",
    "everything that",
    "comes up from",
    "bottles or buoys to",
    "sharks and porpoises",
    "I never slept",
    "or ate better in",
    "my life."
   ],
